~ ambushed
Winston: Well, well, well. What do we have here, pint-size?
Fenn: Why do you call me that? I'm Fenn.
Winston: Well [i]Fenn[/i]. If that even is your real name. Uh... I mean... wait what?
Winston: Oh yeah! I nearly forgot. The ambush!
Winston: Tread carefully, my friend. It would such a shame if you were crushed by my creations.
Az: Fenn, you alright?
Winston: WHAT? WHO'S THAT?
Fenn: I'm good, Az. Wizard man is just ambushing me.
Winston: AZ?? Like apprentice Az? Like Az Featherstone, Az?
Fenn: Yeah. We're like best friends.
Az: No- sigh. Nevermind.
Winston: Hmmm. Ahem. Fine.
Winston: TAKE THIS!
=> END


~ escaped
Az: Hah! Nice work, kid. 
Winston: IMPOSSIBLE! Arrrgh! 
Winston: How did you evade my attacks?
Fenn: Oh, well Az gave me this really cool bangle. She can help me from far away.
Winston: Arggh. I just need to do better. More machines, more snow, more creatures...
Winston: I doubt you have any more stupid tricks up your sleeve.
Fenn: Isn't it so cool?
Winston: I never said it was cool!!
Winston: Arrrgh!!!!
Winston runs off
=> END
